        "If axis=y, exchange the coordinates: X=sy*(y-cy) mod n and Y=sx*(x-cx) mod m; set a=n,b=m.",
        "In either case the hole is {(0,0),(1,0),(0,1),(1,1)} in (X,Y)-coordinates.",
